RULE30 ALL-PERIOD AMPLITUDE-LATTICE AUDIT
THEOREM n=2^a*m, d=n/2^min(a,r), s=r-min(a,r)
IMAGE period-d vectors whose primitive-block sum is 0 mod 2^s
SMITH diag(1^(d-1),2^s,0^(n-d))
COKERNEL Z^(n-d) direct-sum Z/(2^s), with Z/(1)=0
