SMITH_UNIVERSE 1<=n<=24, 0<=r<=8
LIFT_UNIVERSE 1<=n<=32, 0<=r<=10, three targets each
EVEN_BOUNDARY rank halves until odd core; later one cyclic 2-carry
NONCLOSING_CONTROL A=(1,5,9) normalizes to (3,5,7), same sum, no projective return
